The Iranian Navy’s public relations office says a tanker caught fire and was disabled after striking a sea mine east of the Strait of Hormuz while sailing in a restricted area with its navigation systems switched off, despite repeated warnings. 

It warned that any vessel ignoring warnings and entering restricted waters could meet the same fate.

