Source: Any strike against Iran will trigger ‘immediate, unlimited and devastating’ response 

A senior Iranian security official has warned that any renewed strike against Iran will be grounds for an “immediate, unlimited, and devastating response,” stressing that the country will impose no geographical, temporal, or target-related limitations on its self-defense.

@PressTV

Yemeni official condemns Saudi massacre in crowded market, vows retaliation for 'war crimes'

A senior Yemeni official has condemned a brutal Saudi airstrike on a crowded market in the southwestern province of Ta'izz that left dozens of civilians dead, warning that the Yemeni Armed Forces retain "many surprises" to retaliate against the ongoing aggression.

