Iranian missiles will reach Europe in case of new US-Israeli aggression, lawmaker warns

An Iranian lawmaker has warned that the country’s retaliatory missile strikes will reach Europe in case of a new US-Israeli war of aggression, pushing oil prices to new record highs.

